SUMMARY:Intermediate Ride (C) with Philly Bike Club- BI ARC First Loop (38
 R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, an
 d Ride Together**\nThe Philly Bike Club is spending the weekend in Bird in
  Hand.\n\nWe are hosting a Saturday morning ride 12-16 mph.\n\nRide leader
 : Dave Stauffer will lead at a 14 mph pace\nWe need a volunteer to lead at
  a 15-16 pace and a volunteer for sweep.\nSweep: Volunteer to Sweep!\nAver
 age Pace: (12-16 mph)\nRoute: [BIH ARC First Loop](https://routes.lancaste
 rbikeclub.net/cue/bi-arc-first-loop-38r/)\n\nThis is an Intermediate C Cla
 ss ride expanded to include a more casual pace group. The ride leader will
  ride at the advertised average speed. This is intended to be a group ride
  with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leaders will do his/her be
 st to keep the pace groups together with occasional regroupings and/or spl
 itting into multiple groups to align to pace capabilities.\n\nThere will b
 e an optional coffee stop in intercourse at approx. 30 miles.\n[The Villag
 e Cafe](http://www.thevillagecafegordonville.com/)\n\nPlease do not join t
 his ride if you are not willing to ride with the group. If you exceed the 
 posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and encouraged to join a fast
 er group. If maintaining a 14-16 mph average is beyond your current abilit
 y level\, please consider joining a slower ride first.\n\nHelmets are mand
 atory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\,
  tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen an
 d paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to j
 oin this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Join h
 ere [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id
 =60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's 
 Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/conte
 nt.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an inci
 dent occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx
 ?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
